# Author: Tigany Zarrouk (tiganyzarrouk@gmail.com)
#
# Isotropic NMR shieldings of a succinic acid crystal, from ShiftML through the
# python backend. ShiftML passes two messages over a 5 A neighbour list, so a
# 10 A ghost shell is what makes the cluster the backend builds equal to the
# periodic answer; comm_modify carries it.
units           metal
atom_style      atomic
boundary        p p p
read_data       data/succinic.data
pair_style      zero 10.0
pair_coeff      * *
comm_modify     cutoff 12.0
compute         cs all mad/property/python mad_shiftml ncomp 1 cutoff 10.0
dump            d all custom 1 nmr_cs.dump id type c_cs
dump_modify     d format float %.8f sort id
run 0
